tr:

'<p class="l-text"><strong>Rastgele say\u0131 \u00fcretimi, dosya I/O ve ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya entegrasyonu</strong>, NumPy\u2019yi \u00f6\u011frenme arac\u0131ndan \u00fcretim arac\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcren becerilerdir. Bu son derste modern rastgele API\u2019yi, olas\u0131l\u0131k da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131, Monte Carlo sim\u00fclasyonlar\u0131n\u0131, veri kal\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, Matplotlib entegrasyonunu ve tamamen NumPy ile olu\u015fturulmu\u015f eksiksiz bir ML boru hatt\u0131n\u0131 ele al\u0131yoruz.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Neden \u00f6nemli:</strong> Her ML deneyi rastgele ba\u015flatma ile ba\u015flar, her veri seti diskte ya\u015far ve her sonu\u00e7 g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirme gerektirir. Bu pratik ara\u00e7lara hakim olmak, ham veriden e\u011fitilmi\u015f modele NumPy\u2019dan ayr\u0131lmadan gidebilmeniz anlam\u0131na gelir.</div>'
+ '<div class="lesson-outcomes" style="background:rgba(200,169,110,0.06);border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><div style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:0.6rem">📍 BU DERSTE ÖĞRENECEKSİN</div><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(235,230,220,0.92)"><li>Modern np.random.default_rng API\'siyle tekrarlanabilir rastgele sayı üret</li><li>Uniform, normal, binom, Poisson ve üstel dağılımlardan örnekle</li><li>Çapraz doğrulama bölmeleri ve stokastik eğitim için dizileri karıştır</li><li>NumPy, PyTorch ve Python random modülünde seed\'i doğru şekilde ayarla</li><li>Olasılıkları ve integralleri tahmin etmek için Monte Carlo simülasyonu kullan</li></ul></div>'


/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 1: Rastgele Mod\u00fcl
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">1. Rastgele Mod\u00fcl</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">NumPy\u2019nin rastgele mod\u00fcl\u00fc, 1.17 s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde tamamen yeniden tasarland\u0131. Yeni API, <code>np.random.default_rng()</code> ile olu\u015fturulan <strong>Generator nesneleri</strong> etraf\u0131nda \u015fekillenmi\u015ftir. Eski API (<code>np.random.rand</code>, <code>np.random.randint</code>) hala \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r ama eski (legacy) olarak kabul edilir. Yeni API daha h\u0131zl\u0131, daha esnek ve istatistiksel olarak daha iyidir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">default_rng()</div><div class="card-body">PCG64 bit \u00fcreteci ile Generator olu\u015fturur. Tekrarlanabilirlik i\u00e7in seed verin: <code>rng = np.random.default_rng(42)</code></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">integers()</div><div class="card-body">D\u00fc\u015f\u00fck (dahil) ile y\u00fcksek (hari\u00e7) aras\u0131nda rastgele tamsay\u0131lar. <code>randint</code>\u2019in yerine ge\u00e7er.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">random()</div><div class="card-body">[0, 1) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tekd\u00fcze ondal\u0131k say\u0131lar. <code>rand</code> ve <code>random_sample</code>\u2019\u0131n yerine ge\u00e7er.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">choice()</div><div class="card-body">Bir diziden rastgele se\u00e7im, de\u011fi\u015ftirmeli veya de\u011fi\u015ftirmesiz. Olas\u0131l\u0131k a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 destekler.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Yeni API (\u00f6nerilen) ----</span>\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)   <span class="cm"># tekrarlanabilirlik i\u00e7in seed</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Rastgele tamsay\u0131lar: d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck (dahil) - y\u00fcksek (hari\u00e7)</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">integers</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">10</span>, size=<span class="num">5</span>))       <span class="cm"># \u00f6rn. [0 7 6 4 4]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">integers</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">10</span>, size=(<span class="num">2</span>,<span class="num">3</span>)))   <span class="cm"># 2x3 matris</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># [0, 1) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tekd\u00fcze ondal\u0131klar</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">random</span>((<span class="num">3</span>,)))                   <span class="cm"># \u00f6rn. [0.123, 0.876, 0.541]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Se\u00e7im: diziden rastgele se\u00e7</span>\nrenkler = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="str">\'kirmizi\'</span>, <span class="str">\'mavi\'</span>, <span class="str">\'yesil\'</span>, <span class="str">\'sari\'</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">choice</span>(renkler, size=<span class="num">3</span>))          <span class="cm"># de\u011fi\u015ftirmeli</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">choice</span>(renkler, size=<span class="num">3</span>, replace=<span class="kw">False</span>))  <span class="cm"># de\u011fi\u015ftirmesiz</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 se\u00e7im</span>\nagirliklar = [<span class="num">0.5</span>, <span class="num">0.3</span>, <span class="num">0.15</span>, <span class="num">0.05</span>]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng.<span class="fn">choice</span>(renkler, size=<span class="num">6</span>, p=agirliklar))\n\n<span class="cm"># Kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma ve perm\u00fctasyon</span>\narr = np.<span class="fn">arange</span>(<span class="num">10</span>)\nrng.<span class="fn">shuffle</span>(arr)                <span class="cm"># yerinde kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr)\n\nperm = rng.<span class="fn">permutation</span>(<span class="num">10</span>)     <span class="cm"># yeni dizi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(perm)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Seed tekrarlanabilirli\u011fi</strong>, bilimsel hesaplama ve hata ay\u0131klama i\u00e7in kritiktir. Ayn\u0131 seed\u2019i verdi\u011finizde, her seferinde tam olarak ayn\u0131 rastgele say\u0131 dizisini al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># Ayn\u0131 seed \u2192 her seferinde ayn\u0131 say\u0131lar</span>\nrng1 = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\nrng2 = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng1.<span class="fn">random</span>(<span class="num">5</span>))    <span class="cm"># [0.773... 0.438... 0.858... ...]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(rng2.<span class="fn">random</span>(<span class="num">5</span>))    <span class="cm"># ayn\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Paralel \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma i\u00e7in ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z ak\u0131\u015flar</span>\nrng_a = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">100</span>)\nrng_b = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">200</span>)\n<span class="cm"># Her ak\u0131\u015f ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z diziler \u00fcretir</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">ESK\u0130 API (Legacy)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.seed(42)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.randint(0, 10)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.rand(3, 4)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.randn(3, 4)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.choice(arr)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">np.random.shuffle(arr)</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">YEN\u0130 API (\u00d6nerilen)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng = default_rng(42)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng.integers(0, 10)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng.random((3, 4))</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng.standard_normal((3, 4))</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng.choice(arr)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">rng.shuffle(arr)</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Neden yeni API?</strong> Eski API, fonksiyonlar aras\u0131nda gizli ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar yaratan global bir durum (<code>np.random.seed</code>) kullan\u0131r. \u0130ki k\u00fct\u00fcphane de <code>np.random.seed</code> \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131rsa, birbirlerini etkiler. Yeni Generator API, her biri kendi durumuna sahip <strong>ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z \u00f6rnekler</strong> kullan\u0131r \u2014 bu sorunu tamamen ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131r.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 2: Olas\u0131l\u0131k Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Olas\u0131l\u0131k Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Generator nesnesi t\u00fcm \u00f6nemli olas\u0131l\u0131k da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131ndan \u00f6rnekleme y\u00f6ntemleri sa\u011flar. Her da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n \u015feklini kontrol eden parametreleri vard\u0131r ve bunlar\u0131 anlamak ML i\u00e7in kritiktir \u2014 a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k ba\u015flatma, g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fc enjeksiyonu, veri art\u0131rma ve Bayes y\u00f6ntemleri hep bu da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlara dayan\u0131r.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>D\u00fczg\u00fcn (uniform) da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m PDF \u2014 bir aral\u0131kta e\u015fit olas\u0131l\u0131k:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$f(x) = \\frac{1}{b - a}, \\quad a \\le x \\le b$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">f(x)</div><div class="card-body">Olas\u0131l\u0131k yo\u011funlu\u011fu. D\u00fczg\u00fcn da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m i\u00e7in [a, b] i\u00e7inde sabit, d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda s\u0131f\u0131rd\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">a, b</div><div class="card-body">Aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n alt ve \u00fcst s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131. b > a olmal\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">1/(b\u2212a)</div><div class="card-body">Sabit yo\u011funluk; dikd\u00f6rtgen alt\u0131ndaki toplam alan 1 olacak bi\u00e7imde se\u00e7ilir, b\u00f6ylece ge\u00e7erli bir PDF olur.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">ML\'de kullan\u0131m</div><div class="card-body">Rastgele arama, baz\u0131 a\u011flarda parametre ba\u015flatma (\u00f6rn. Xavier uniform), dropout \u00f6rnekleme.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Normal (Gauss) da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 PDF \u2014 \u00e7an e\u011frisi:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$f(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}} \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03bc</div><div class="card-body">Ortalama \u2014 da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n merkezi. E\u011frinin yerini sa\u011fa/sola kayd\u0131r\u0131r, \u015feklini de\u011fi\u015ftirmez.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c3</div><div class="card-body">Standart sapma \u2014 yay\u0131l\u0131m. B\u00fcy\u00fck \u03c3 daha geni\u015f e\u011fri; k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck \u03c3 daha dar ve tepe daha y\u00fcksek.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">exp(...)</div><div class="card-body">\u00c7an \u015feklini veren \u00fcstel azalma. Karesel sapma simetriyi garanti eder; 2\u03c3\u00b2\'ye b\u00f6lme olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n ne kadar h\u0131zl\u0131 azalaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Neden bu kadar yayg\u0131n</div><div class="card-body">Merkezi Limit Teoremi: \u00e7ok say\u0131da ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z rastgele de\u011fi\u015fkenin toplam\u0131 normale yakla\u015f\u0131r. Bu y\u00fczden ML ve fizikte normal g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fc bask\u0131nd\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Binom da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 PMF \u2014 n ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z denemede ba\u015far\u0131 say\u0131s\u0131:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$P(X = k) = \\binom{n}{k} p^{k} (1-p)^{n-k}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">P(X=k)</div><div class="card-body">n denemenin tam olarak k tanesinde ba\u015far\u0131 olma olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131. Kesikli (discrete) bir da\u011f\u0131l\u0131md\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">n</div><div class="card-body">Toplam ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z deneme say\u0131s\u0131 (\u00f6rn. yaz\u0131-tura at\u0131\u015f\u0131). \u00d6nceden sabittir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">p</div><div class="card-body">Tek bir denemenin ba\u015far\u0131 olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131. (1\u2212p) ise ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131k olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">C(n,k)</div><div class="card-body">Binom katsay\u0131s\u0131 n!/(k!(n\u2212k)!) \u2014 n deneme aras\u0131nda k ba\u015far\u0131n\u0131n ka\u00e7 farkl\u0131 s\u0131rada gelebilece\u011fini sayar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">ML\'de kullan\u0131m</div><div class="card-body">A/B testi modelleme, dropout maskeleri (her birim p olas\u0131l\u0131kla tutulur), etiket g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fcs\u00fc modellemesi.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Poisson da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 PMF \u2014 sabit aral\u0131kta nadir olay say\u0131m\u0131:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$P(X = k) = \\frac{\\lambda^{k} e^{-\\lambda}}{k!}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">P(X=k)</div><div class="card-body">Olaylar\u0131n sabit ortalama h\u0131zla ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z \u015fekilde ger\u00e7ekle\u015fti\u011fi bir zaman/uzay aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tam k olay olma olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03bb (lambda)</div><div class="card-body">Ortalama h\u0131z (aral\u0131kta beklenen olay say\u0131s\u0131). Hem ortalama hem varyans \u03bb\'ya e\u015fittir \u2014 Poisson\'un ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 \u00f6zelli\u011fi.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">k!</div><div class="card-body">k\'n\u0131n fakt\u00f6riyeli = k\u00b7(k\u22121)\u00b7...\u00b71. Olaylar\u0131n hangi s\u0131rada olabilece\u011fine g\u00f6re normalle\u015ftirir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u00d6rnekler</div><div class="card-body">Dakikadaki ziyaret say\u0131s\u0131, sayfadaki yaz\u0131m hatas\u0131, saniyede sens\u00f6re \u00e7arpan foton, korpuste nadir kelime say\u0131m\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Normal (Gauss)</div><div class="step-detail"><code>rng.normal(loc=0, scale=1, size)</code> \u2014 <code>loc</code> (ortalama) merkezli, <code>scale</code> (std sapma) yay\u0131l\u0131ml\u0131 \u00e7an e\u011frisi. A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k ba\u015flatma, g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fc ve do\u011fal olaylar\u0131 modellemek i\u00e7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Tekd\u00fcze (Uniform)</div><div class="step-detail"><code>rng.uniform(low=0, high=1, size)</code> \u2014 [low, high) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda e\u015fit olas\u0131l\u0131k. Rastgele arama, veri art\u0131rma ve parametre ba\u015flatma i\u00e7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Binom</div><div class="step-detail"><code>rng.binomial(n, p, size)</code> \u2014 Ba\u015far\u0131 olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 <code>p</code> olan <code>n</code> denemede ba\u015far\u0131 say\u0131s\u0131. Evet/hay\u0131r deneylerini modeller: yaz\u0131-tura, A/B testleri, dropout maskeleri.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Poisson</div><div class="step-detail"><code>rng.poisson(lam, size)</code> \u2014 <code>lam</code> oran\u0131yla sabit bir aral\u0131ktaki olay say\u0131s\u0131. Web sitesi ziyaretleri, par\u00e7ac\u0131k bozunmas\u0131, m\u00fc\u015fteri var\u0131\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 modeller.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">5</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">\u00dcssel (Exponential)</div><div class="step-detail"><code>rng.exponential(scale, size)</code> \u2014 Poisson s\u00fcrecinde olaylar aras\u0131ndaki s\u00fcre. <code>scale</code> = 1/oran. Bekleme s\u00fcrelerini ve bozunmay\u0131 modeller.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Normal: ortalama=0, std=1 (standart normal)</span>\nnormal_ornekler = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(loc=<span class="num">0</span>, scale=<span class="num">1</span>, size=<span class="num">10000</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Ort: {normal_ornekler.mean():.3f}, Std: {normal_ornekler.std():.3f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00d6zel parametreli normal (\u00f6rn. boy da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131)</span>\nboylar = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(loc=<span class="num">170</span>, scale=<span class="num">10</span>, size=<span class="num">1000</span>)  <span class="cm"># cm</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># [0, 10) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tekd\u00fcze</span>\ntekduze_ornekler = rng.<span class="fn">uniform</span>(low=<span class="num">0</span>, high=<span class="num">10</span>, size=<span class="num">10000</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Binom: 10 yaz\u0131-tura, P(yaz\u0131)=0.5, 1000 deney</span>\natislar = rng.<span class="fn">binomial</span>(n=<span class="num">10</span>, p=<span class="num">0.5</span>, size=<span class="num">1000</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"10 at\u0131\u015fta ortalama yaz\u0131: {atislar.mean():.2f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Poisson: aral\u0131k ba\u015f\u0131na ortalama 4 olay</span>\nolaylar = rng.<span class="fn">poisson</span>(lam=<span class="num">4</span>, size=<span class="num">10000</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00dcssel: ortalama bekleme s\u00fcresi = 2</span>\nbeklemeler = rng.<span class="fn">exponential</span>(scale=<span class="num">2</span>, size=<span class="num">10000</span>)</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Olas\u0131l\u0131k Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-dist-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
