+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik neyi g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> \u00dc\u00e7 temel da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m \u00fcst \u00fcste bindirilmi\u015f. Normal (ye\u015fil) 0\u2019da merkezlenmi\u015f klasik \u00e7an e\u011frisidir. Tekd\u00fcze (k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131) 0 ile 4 aras\u0131nda sabit yo\u011funlu\u011fa sahiptir. \u00dcssel (mavi) h\u0131zla azal\u0131r \u2014 \u00e7o\u011fu de\u011fer s\u0131f\u0131ra yak\u0131nd\u0131r.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="think-box"><strong>D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn:</strong> Sinir a\u011f\u0131 a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131rken neden <code>uniform(0, 1)</code> yerine <code>normal(0, 0.01)</code> kullan\u0131yoruz? \u00c7\u00fcnk\u00fc s\u0131f\u0131ra yak\u0131n k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck de\u011ferler, aktivasyon fonksiyonlar\u0131n\u0131n doymas\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nler. Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m \u015fekli do\u011frudan \u00f6\u011frenme dinami\u011fini etkiler.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 3: \u00d6rnekleme & Sim\u00fclasyon
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. \u00d6rnekleme & Sim\u00fclasyon</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Rastgele say\u0131lar sadece veri \u00fcretmek i\u00e7in de\u011fildir \u2014 bilim ve m\u00fchendislikteki en \u00f6nemli hesaplama tekniklerinden baz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7lendirirler. <strong>Bootstrap \u00f6rneklemesi</strong> parametrik varsay\u0131mlar olmadan belirsizli\u011fi tahmin eder. <strong>Monte Carlo y\u00f6ntemleri</strong> rastgele \u00f6rnekleme yoluyla \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fclmesi zor problemleri \u00e7\u00f6zer. <strong>Rastgele y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015fler</strong> hisse senedi fiyatlar\u0131ndan molek\u00fcler dif\u00fczyona kadar her \u015feyi modeller.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Monte Carlo tahmincisi \u2014 herhangi bir beklenen de\u011feri \u00f6rnek ortalamas\u0131yla yakla\u015f\u0131kla:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\hat{\\theta} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N} f(x_i), \\qquad \\text{hata} \\sim \\mathcal{O}\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}}\\right)$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03b8</div><div class="card-body">Monte Carlo tahmini \u2014 ger\u00e7ek beklenen de\u011fer E[f(X)]\'in say\u0131sal yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">f(x_i)</div><div class="card-body">Hedef da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mdan \u00e7ekilen her x_i \u00f6rne\u011fi i\u00e7in fonksiyon de\u011feri. Olas\u0131l\u0131k i\u00e7in g\u00f6sterge fonksiyonu ya da hesaplanabilir herhangi bir nicelik olabilir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">N</div><div class="card-body">\u00c7ekilen rastgele \u00f6rnek say\u0131s\u0131. Daha \u00e7ok \u00f6rnek = daha do\u011fru tahmin.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">O(1/\u221aN)</div><div class="card-body">Yak\u0131nsama h\u0131z\u0131 \u2014 hatay\u0131 yar\u0131ya indirmek i\u00e7in 4 kat daha \u00e7ok \u00f6rnek gerekir. Yava\u015f ama boyuttan ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z; y\u00fcksek boyutta Monte Carlo bu y\u00fczden kazan\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Kullan\u0131m alanlar\u0131</div><div class="card-body">\u03c0 tahmini, integral hesaplama, fiziksel sistem sim\u00fclasyonu, Bayes \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131m\u0131 (MCMC), peki\u015ftirmeli \u00f6\u011frenmede rollout\'lar.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">BOOTSTRAP \u00d6RNEKLEMES\u0130</div><div class="example-body"><strong>Problem:</strong> 100 veri noktan\u0131z var ve ortalama i\u00e7in g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 istiyorsunuz, ama pop\u00fclasyon da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 bilmiyorsunuz.<br><br><strong>\u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm:</strong> Verilerinizden <em>de\u011fi\u015ftirmeli olarak</em> binlerce kez yeniden \u00f6rnekleyin. Her yeniden \u00f6rnekleme farkl\u0131 bir ortalama verir. Bu ortalamalar\u0131n da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 size g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 verir \u2014 varsay\u0131m gerekmez.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Orijinal veri: 100 s\u0131nav notu</span>\nnotlar = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(loc=<span class="num">72</span>, scale=<span class="num">12</span>, size=<span class="num">100</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"\u00d6rnek ortalama: {notlar.mean():.2f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Bootstrap: 10.000 kez yeniden \u00f6rnekle</span>\nn_bootstrap = <span class="num">10000</span>\nboot_ort = np.<span class="fn">empty</span>(n_bootstrap)\n<span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(n_bootstrap):\n    ornek = rng.<span class="fn">choice</span>(notlar, size=<span class="fn">len</span>(notlar), replace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n    boot_ort[i] = ornek.<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># %95 g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131</span>\nci_alt = np.<span class="fn">percentile</span>(boot_ort, <span class="num">2.5</span>)\nci_ust = np.<span class="fn">percentile</span>(boot_ort, <span class="num">97.5</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"%95 GA: [{ci_alt:.2f}, {ci_ust:.2f}]"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">MONTE CARLO: PI TAHM\u0130N\u0130</div><div class="example-body"><strong>Fikir:</strong> Birim kareye dart at\u0131n. \u0130\u00e7 \u00e7eyre daireye d\u00fc\u015fen dartlar\u0131n toplama oran\u0131 \u03c0/4\u2019\u00fc yakla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Yeterince dart ile \u03c0\u2019nin kesin bir tahminini elde ederiz.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Pi\u2019nin Monte Carlo tahmini</span>\nn_nokta = <span class="num">1000000</span>\nx = rng.<span class="fn">random</span>(n_nokta)   <span class="cm"># x [0, 1) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda</span>\ny = rng.<span class="fn">random</span>(n_nokta)   <span class="cm"># y [0, 1) aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00c7eyre dairenin i\u00e7inde mi: x\u00b2 + y\u00b2 \u2264 1</span>\nicinde = (x**<span class="num">2</span> + y**<span class="num">2</span>) <= <span class="num">1.0</span>\npi_tahmini = <span class="num">4.0</span> * icinde.<span class="fn">sum</span>() / n_nokta\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Tahmini \u03c0: {pi_tahmini:.6f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Ger\u00e7ek \u03c0:  {np.pi:.6f}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Rastgele y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f sim\u00fclasyonu</strong> stokastik s\u00fcre\u00e7leri modeller. Her zaman ad\u0131m\u0131nda y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00e7\u00fc rastgele bir ad\u0131m atar. Bu basit model hisse senedi fiyatlar\u0131n\u0131, molek\u00fcler dif\u00fczyonu ve hatta PageRank\u2019i tan\u0131mlar.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># 5 rastgele y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f, her biri 200 ad\u0131m</span>\nn_yuruyus = <span class="num">5</span>\nn_adim = <span class="num">200</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Her ad\u0131m e\u015fit olas\u0131l\u0131kla +1 veya -1</span>\nadimlar = rng.<span class="fn">choice</span>([-<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>], size=(n_yuruyus, n_adim))\n\n<span class="cm"># K\u00fcm\u00fclatif toplam her zamandaki konumu verir</span>\nkonumlar = np.<span class="fn">cumsum</span>(adimlar, axis=<span class="num">1</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># \u0130statistikler</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Son konumlar: {konumlar[:, -1]}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Maks yer de\u011fi\u015ftirme: {np.abs(konumlar).max()}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Rastgele Y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-walk-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'function makeWalk(seed,n){'
+ 'var pos=[0];var s=seed;'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){s=(s*1103515245+12345)&0x7fffffff;pos.push(pos[pos.length-1]+(s%2===0?1:-1));}'
+ 'return pos;}'
+ 'var steps=Array.from({length:201},function(_,i){return i;});'
+ 'var colors=["#4de87a","#f87171","#60a5fa","#c8a96e","#a78bfa"];'
+ 'var traces=[];'
+ 'for(var w=0;w<5;w++){'
+ 'traces.push({x:steps,y:makeWalk(42+w*17,200),name:"Y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f "+(w+1),type:"scatter",mode:"lines",line:{color:colors[w],width:2}});}'
+ 'var layout={title:{text:"Rastgele Y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f Sim\u00fclasyonu (5 y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00e7\u00fc, 200 ad\u0131m)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:14}},paper_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",plot_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},xaxis:{title:"Ad\u0131m",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},yaxis:{title:"Konum",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)",zeroline:true,zerolinecolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"},margin:{t:50,r:30,b:50,l:60},legend:{font:{color:"#ebe6dc"}}};'
+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-walk-tr",traces,layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik neyi g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> S\u0131f\u0131r konumundan ba\u015flayan be\u015f ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z rastgele y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00e7\u00fc. Her ad\u0131m e\u015fit olas\u0131l\u0131kla +1 veya -1. Simetriye ra\u011fmen y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015f\u00e7\u00fcler ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7tan uzakla\u015f\u0131r. Kare ortalama yer de\u011fi\u015ftirme n de\u011fil \u221an olarak b\u00fcy\u00fcr \u2014 olas\u0131l\u0131k teorisinde temel bir sonu\u00e7tür.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 4: Dosya I/O
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. Dosya I/O</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">NumPy, her biri farkl\u0131 kullan\u0131m durumlar\u0131 i\u00e7in optimize edilmi\u015f birden fazla dizi kaydetme ve y\u00fckleme y\u00f6ntemi sa\u011flar. \u0130kili formatlar (<code>.npy</code>, <code>.npz</code>) h\u0131zl\u0131 ve kompaktt\u0131r. Metin formatlar\u0131 (<code>.csv</code>, <code>.txt</code>) insan taraf\u0131ndan okunabilir ve ta\u015f\u0131nabilirdir. Bellek e\u015flemeli dosyalar RAM\u2019e s\u0131\u011fmayacak kadar b\u00fcy\u00fck dizilerle \u00e7al\u0131\u015fman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.save / np.load</div><div class="card-body">Tek dizi, ikili format. En h\u0131zl\u0131. Dtype ve \u015fekli tam olarak korur. Ara sonu\u00e7lar ve \u00f6nbellekleme i\u00e7in kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.savez / np.savez_compressed</div><div class="card-body">Bir ar\u015fivde birden fazla dizi. Dict gibi isme g\u00f6re eri\u015fin. S\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f s\u00fcr\u00fcm disk alan\u0131 tasarrufu sa\u011flar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.savetxt / np.loadtxt</div><div class="card-body">\u0130nsan taraf\u0131ndan okunabilir metin. B\u00fcy\u00fck veriler i\u00e7in yava\u015f. Python d\u0131\u015f\u0131 ara\u00e7larla payla\u015fmak i\u00e7in iyi.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.memmap</div><div class="card-body">Bellek e\u015flemeli dosya: devasa dizilere RAM\u2019e y\u00fcklemeden eri\u015fin. \u0130\u015fletim sistemi gerekti\u011finde veriyi i\u00e7eri/d\u0131\u015far\u0131 sayfaland\u0131r\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\ndata = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(size=(<span class="num">1000</span>, <span class="num">5</span>))\netiketler = rng.<span class="fn">integers</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, size=<span class="num">1000</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .npy: tek dizi ----</span>\nnp.<span class="fn">save</span>(<span class="str">\'data.npy\'</span>, data)            <span class="cm"># kaydet</span>\nyuklenen = np.<span class="fn">load</span>(<span class="str">\'data.npy\'</span>)        <span class="cm"># y\u00fckle (ayn\u0131 dizi)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .npz: birden fazla dizi ----</span>\nnp.<span class="fn">savez</span>(<span class="str">\'veriseti.npz\'</span>, X=data, y=etiketler)\narsiv = np.<span class="fn">load</span>(<span class="str">\'veriseti.npz\'</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arsiv[<span class="str">\'X\'</span>].shape)              <span class="cm"># (1000, 5)</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arsiv[<span class="str">\'y\'</span>].shape)              <span class="cm"># (1000,)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f s\u00fcr\u00fcm</span>\nnp.<span class="fn">savez_compressed</span>(<span class="str">\'veriseti_kucuk.npz\'</span>, X=data, y=etiketler)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .csv: metin format\u0131 ----</span>\nnp.<span class="fn">savetxt</span>(<span class="str">\'data.csv\'</span>, data, delimiter=<span class="str">\',\'</span>,\n          header=<span class="str">\'f1,f2,f3,f4,f5\'</span>, fmt=<span class="str">\'%.4f\'</span>)\nyuklenen_csv = np.<span class="fn">loadtxt</span>(<span class="str">\'data.csv\'</span>, delimiter=<span class="str">\',\'</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>np.genfromtxt</strong>, <code>loadtxt</code>\u2019un ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kamad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\u00fczensiz ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya verilerini i\u015fler \u2014 eksik de\u011ferler, kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k tipler ve tutars\u0131z bi\u00e7imlendirme:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># genfromtxt eksik de\u011ferleri zarif\u00e7e i\u015fler</span>\n<span class="cm"># \u015e\u00f6yle bir CSV d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn:</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1.0, 2.0, 3.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4.0,    , 6.0     \u2190 eksik de\u011fer!</span>\n<span class="cm"># 7.0, 8.0, 9.0</span>\n\ndata = np.<span class="fn">genfromtxt</span>(<span class="str">\'duzensiz.csv\'</span>, delimiter=<span class="str">\',\'</span>,\n                     missing_values=<span class="str">\'\'</span>,\n                     filling_values=np.nan)  <span class="cm"># eksikler i\u00e7in NaN</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Dev veri setleri i\u00e7in bellek e\u015flenmi\u015f dosya ----</span>\nmmap_arr = np.<span class="fn">memmap</span>(<span class="str">\'dev_data.dat\'</span>, dtype=<span class="str">\'float64\'</span>,\n                     mode=<span class="str">\'w+\'</span>, shape=(<span class="num">1000000</span>, <span class="num">100</span>))\nmmap_arr[<span class="num">0</span>] = np.<span class="fn">arange</span>(<span class="num">100</span>)\nmmap_arr.<span class="fn">flush</span>()    <span class="cm"># verinin diske yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emin ol</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Geri oku (tembel y\u00fckleme: sadece eri\u015filen sat\u0131rlar RAM\u2019de)</span>\nmmap_oku = np.<span class="fn">memmap</span>(<span class="str">\'dev_data.dat\'</span>, dtype=<span class="str">\'float64\'</span>,\n                     mode=<span class="str">\'r\'</span>, shape=(<span class="num">1000000</span>, <span class="num">100</span>))\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mmap_oku[<span class="num">0</span>, :<span class="num">5</span>])  <span class="cm"># [0. 1. 2. 3. 4.]</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Performans ipucu:</strong> ML boru hatlar\u0131 i\u00e7in \u00f6ni\u015flenmi\u015f verilerinizi her zaman <code>.npy</code> veya <code>.npz</code> olarak kaydedin. 100MB\u2019l\u0131k bir <code>.npy</code> dosyas\u0131n\u0131 y\u00fcklemek ~50ms s\u00fcrer. Ayn\u0131 veriyi CSV\u2019den y\u00fcklemek ~5 saniye s\u00fcrer \u2014 100\u00d7 fark. CSV\u2019yi yaln\u0131zca insan okunabilirli\u011fi veya Excel uyumlulu\u011fu gerekti\u011finde kaydedin.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 5: NumPy + Matplotlib Entegrasyonu
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. NumPy + Matplotlib Entegrasyonu</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Matplotlib, NumPy \u00fczerine in\u015fa edilmi\u015ftir \u2014 her grafik girdi olarak NumPy dizileri al\u0131r. Bu ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 anlamak, hesaplamadan g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirmeye sorunsuz ge\u00e7menizi sa\u011flar. Burada veri bilimi ve ML i\u00e7in temel \u00e7izim kal\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131 ele al\u0131yoruz.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n<span class="kw">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class="kw">as</span> plt\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- \u00c7izgi grafi\u011fi: fonksiyon e\u011frileri ----</span>\nx = np.<span class="fn">linspace</span>(-<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">200</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">figure</span>(figsize=(<span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">4</span>))\nplt.<span class="fn">plot</span>(x, np.<span class="fn">sin</span>(x), label=<span class="str">\'sin(x)\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">plot</span>(x, np.<span class="fn">cos</span>(x), label=<span class="str">\'cos(x)\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">plot</span>(x, np.<span class="fn">exp</span>(-x**<span class="num">2</span>), label=<span class="str">\'Gauss\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">legend</span>(); plt.<span class="fn">grid</span>(<span class="kw">True</span>); plt.<span class="fn">title</span>(<span class="str">\'NumPy Fonksiyonlar\u0131\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">show</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Histogram: da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirme ----</span>\nornekler = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">10000</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">hist</span>(ornekler, bins=<span class="num">50</span>, density=<span class="kw">True</span>, alpha=<span class="num">0.7</span>)\n<span class="cm"># Teorik PDF \u00fcst \u00fcste</span>\nx_pdf = np.<span class="fn">linspace</span>(-<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">200</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">plot</span>(x_pdf, np.<span class="fn">exp</span>(-x_pdf**<span class="num">2</span>/<span class="num">2</span>)/np.<span class="fn">sqrt</span>(<span class="num">2</span>*np.pi), <span class="str">\'r-\'</span>, lw=<span class="num">2</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">title</span>(<span class="str">\'Normal Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m: \u00d6rnekler vs Teori\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">show</span>()</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n<span class="kw">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class="kw">as</span> plt\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- imshow: 2B dizileri g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc olarak g\u00f6rselle\u015ftir ----</span>\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\nmatris = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(size=(<span class="num">20</span>, <span class="num">20</span>))\n\nplt.<span class="fn">figure</span>(figsize=(<span class="num">6</span>, <span class="num">5</span>))\nplt.<span class="fn">imshow</span>(matris, cmap=<span class="str">\'viridis\'</span>, interpolation=<span class="str">\'nearest\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">colorbar</span>(label=<span class="str">\'De\u011fer\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">title</span>(<span class="str">\'2B Dizi Is\u0131 Haritas\u0131 Olarak\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">show</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Kontur grafi\u011fi: 2B fonksiyonlar ----</span>\nx = np.<span class="fn">linspace</span>(-<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">100</span>)\ny = np.<span class="fn">linspace</span>(-<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">100</span>)\nX, Y = np.<span class="fn">meshgrid</span>(x, y)     <span class="cm"># 1B vekt\u00f6rlerden 2B \u0131zgara</span>\nZ = np.<span class="fn">exp</span>(-(X**<span class="num">2</span> + Y**<span class="num">2</span>))  <span class="cm"># 2B Gauss</span>\n\nplt.<span class="fn">figure</span>(figsize=(<span class="num">6</span>, <span class="num">5</span>))\nplt.<span class="fn">contourf</span>(X, Y, Z, levels=<span class="num">20</span>, cmap=<span class="str">\'plasma\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">colorbar</span>()\nplt.<span class="fn">contour</span>(X, Y, Z, levels=<span class="num">10</span>, colors=<span class="str">\'white\'</span>, linewidths=<span class="num">0.5</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">title</span>(<span class="str">\'2B Gauss Kontur Grafi\u011fi\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">show</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- NumPy ile hesaplanan renkli da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m ----</span>\nn = <span class="num">500</span>\nx = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(size=n)\ny = <span class="num">0.5</span> * x + rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(scale=<span class="num">0.3</span>, size=n)\nrenkler = np.<span class="fn">sqrt</span>(x**<span class="num">2</span> + y**<span class="num">2</span>)  <span class="cm"># orijine uzakl\u0131k</span>\n\nplt.<span class="fn">scatter</span>(x, y, c=renkler, cmap=<span class="str">\'cool\'</span>, alpha=<span class="num">0.6</span>, s=<span class="num">10</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">colorbar</span>(label=<span class="str">\'Orijine uzakl\u0131k\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">title</span>(<span class="str">\'NumPy ile hesaplanan renk e\u015flemeli da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\'</span>)\nplt.<span class="fn">show</span>()</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Anahtar kal\u0131p:</strong> Matplotlib verilerinizi asla kopyalamaz \u2014 do\u011frudan NumPy dizilerinden okur. Bu, <code>plt.show()</code> \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131lmadan \u00f6nce dizilerinize yap\u0131lan yerinde de\u011fi\u015fiklikler grafi\u011fi etkileyece\u011fi anlam\u0131na gelir. \u00c7izimden \u00f6nce dizilerinizi sonland\u0131r\u0131n veya <code>.copy()</code> ile a\u00e7\u0131k kopya yap\u0131n.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 6: Ger\u00e7ek D\u00fcnya Projesi
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Ger\u00e7ek D\u00fcnya Projesi: Saf NumPy ile ML Boru Hatt\u0131</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Yaln\u0131zca NumPy kullanarak <strong>eksiksiz bir makine \u00f6\u011frenimi boru hatt\u0131</strong> in\u015fa edelim. S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma veri seti \u00fcretece\u011fiz, \u00f6znitelikleri \u00f6ni\u015fleyece\u011fiz, yenilerini m\u00fchendislikleyece\u011fiz, e\u011fitim/test olarak b\u00f6lece\u011fiz, s\u0131f\u0131rdan lojistik regresyon uygulayaca\u011f\u0131z, gradient inimiyle e\u011fitece\u011fiz ve karar s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirece\u011fiz. Her ML k\u00fct\u00fcphanesi arka planda tam olarak bunlar\u0131 yapar.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Veri \u00dcret</div><div class="step-detail">Farkl\u0131 ortalamalarla normal da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar kullanarak 2 \u00f6znitelikli 2 s\u0131n\u0131fl\u0131 veri seti olu\u015ftür.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">\u00d6ni\u015fle</div><div class="step-detail">\u00d6znitelikleri s\u0131f\u0131r ortalama ve birim varyans\u0131 olarak standartla\u015ft\u0131r: z = (x - ortalama) / std.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">\u00d6znitelik M\u00fchendisli\u011fi</div><div class="step-detail">Do\u011frusal olmayan karar s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 yakalamak i\u00e7in polinom \u00f6znitelikleri (x\u00b2, x\u00b9x\u00b2) ekle.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">E\u011fitim/Test B\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc</div><div class="step-detail">Rastgele kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve b\u00f6l: %80 e\u011fitim, %20 test. Test verisinde asla e\u011fitme!</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">5</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Lojistik Regresyon</div><div class="step-detail">Sigmoid, \u00e7apraz entropi kayb\u0131 ve gradient ini\u015fi uygula. Hepsi NumPy vekt\u00f6rize i\u015flemlerle.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">6</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">De\u011ferlendir & G\u00f6rselle\u015ftir</div><div class="step-detail">Test setinde do\u011fruluk hesapla ve meshgrid + kontur kullanarak karar s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7iz.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nrng = np.random.<span class="fn">default_rng</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 1: Veri \u00fcret ==========</span>\nn_ornek = <span class="num">300</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u0131n\u0131f 0: (-1, -1) civar\u0131nda merkezli</span>\nX0 = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(loc=[-<span class="num">1</span>, -<span class="num">1</span>], scale=<span class="num">0.8</span>, size=(n_ornek//<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">2</span>))\n<span class="cm"># S\u0131n\u0131f 1: (1, 1) civar\u0131nda merkezli</span>\nX1 = rng.<span class="fn">normal</span>(loc=[<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>], scale=<span class="num">0.8</span>, size=(n_ornek//<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">2</span>))\n\nX = np.<span class="fn">vstack</span>([X0, X1])                    <span class="cm"># (300, 2)</span>\ny = np.<span class="fn">hstack</span>([np.<span class="fn">zeros</span>(n_ornek//<span class="num">2</span>),\n              np.<span class="fn">ones</span>(n_ornek//<span class="num">2</span>)])     <span class="cm"># (300,)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 2: Standartla\u015ft\u0131r ==========</span>\nort = X.<span class="fn">mean</span>(axis=<span class="num">0</span>)\nstd = X.<span class="fn">std</span>(axis=<span class="num">0</span>)\nX_olcekli = (X - ort) / std\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 3: Polinom \u00f6znitelikleri ==========</span>\nX_poly = np.<span class="fn">column_stack</span>([\n    X_olcekli,\n    X_olcekli[:, <span class="num">0</span>] ** <span class="num">2</span>,                <span class="cm"># x1\u00b2</span>\n    X_olcekli[:, <span class="num">1</span>] ** <span class="num">2</span>,                <span class="cm"># x2\u00b2</span>\n    X_olcekli[:, <span class="num">0</span>] * X_olcekli[:, <span class="num">1</span>],  <span class="cm"># x1*x2</span>\n])   <span class="cm"># (300, 5)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 4: E\u011fitim/test b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc ==========</span>\nidx = rng.<span class="fn">permutation</span>(n_ornek)\negitim_boyut = <span class="kw">int</span>(<span class="num">0.8</span> * n_ornek)\n\nX_egitim = X_poly[idx[:egitim_boyut]]\ny_egitim = y[idx[:egitim_boyut]]\nX_test   = X_poly[idx[egitim_boyut:]]\ny_test   = y[idx[egitim_boyut:]]\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"E\u011fitim: {X_egitim.shape}, Test: {X_test.shape}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 5: S\u0131f\u0131rdan Lojistik Regresyon ==========</span>\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sigmoid</span>(z):\n    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="num">1</span> / (<span class="num">1</span> + np.<span class="fn">exp</span>(-np.<span class="fn">clip</span>(z, -<span class="num">500</span>, <span class="num">500</span>)))  <span class="cm"># kararl\u0131l\u0131k i\u00e7in clip</span>\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">capraz_entropi_kaybi</span>(y_gercek, y_tahmin):\n    eps = <span class="num">1e-15</span>\n    y_tahmin = np.<span class="fn">clip</span>(y_tahmin, eps, <span class="num">1</span> - eps)\n    <span class="kw">return</span> -np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(y_gercek * np.<span class="fn">log</span>(y_tahmin)\n                  + (<span class="num">1</span> - y_gercek) * np.<span class="fn">log</span>(<span class="num">1</span> - y_tahmin))\n\n<span class="cm"># Bias s\u00fctunu ekle (1\u2019ler s\u00fctunu)</span>\nX_egitim_b = np.<span class="fn">column_stack</span>([np.<span class="fn">ones</span>(X_egitim.shape[<span class="num">0</span>]), X_egitim])\nX_test_b   = np.<span class="fn">column_stack</span>([np.<span class="fn">ones</span>(X_test.shape[<span class="num">0</span>]),  X_test])\n\n<span class="cm"># A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131ra ba\u015flat</span>\nagirliklar = np.<span class="fn">zeros</span>(X_egitim_b.shape[<span class="num">1</span>])  <span class="cm"># (6,)</span>\nogrenme_orani = <span class="num">0.1</span>\nn_epoch = <span class="num">200</span>\nkayiplar = []\n\n<span class="cm"># Gradient ini\u015fi</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> epoch <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(n_epoch):\n    <span class="cm"># \u0130leri ge\u00e7i\u015f (tam vekt\u00f6rize!)</span>\n    z = X_egitim_b @ agirliklar           <span class="cm"># (240,)</span>\n    tahminler = <span class="fn">sigmoid</span>(z)                <span class="cm"># (240,)</span>\n    \n    <span class="cm"># Kay\u0131p hesapla</span>\n    kayip = <span class="fn">capraz_entropi_kaybi</span>(y_egitim, tahminler)\n    kayiplar.<span class="fn">append</span>(kayip)\n    \n    <span class="cm"># Geri ge\u00e7i\u015f: a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klara g\u00f6re kayb\u0131n gradienti</span>\n    hatalar = tahminler - y_egitim        <span class="cm"># (240,)</span>\n    gradientler = X_egitim_b.T @ hatalar / <span class="fn">len</span>(y_egitim)  <span class="cm"># (6,)</span>\n    \n    <span class="cm"># A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131 g\u00fcncelle</span>\n    agirliklar -= ogrenme_orani * gradientler\n    \n    <span class="kw">if</span> epoch % <span class="num">50</span> == <span class="num">0</span>:\n        <span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"Epoch {epoch:3d} | Kay\u0131p: {kayip:.4f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ========== ADIM 6: De\u011ferlendirme ==========</span>\ntest_tahmin = <span class="fn">sigmoid</span>(X_test_b @ agirliklar)\ntest_etiket = (test_tahmin >= <span class="num">0.5</span>).<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="kw">int</span>)\ndogruluk = np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(test_etiket == y_test)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="str">"\\nTest Do\u011frulu\u011fu: {dogruluk:.2%}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># ~%95</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Karar S\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-boundary-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
